   "type": "text",
   "x": 608,
   "y": 814.375,
   "width": 484,
   "height": 106.25,
   "text": "Takeover\na worker on another model that stops or\nreturns nothing hands its part back: the\nmain agent does it; after 2 failures that\njob runs on the main model",
